Z||000006||Pontiaddict||07-06-2001||02:01 AM||||The bonniville, later grand am (when they started going to the rounded body style) and firebird dashes are all supposed to be too wide to fit into a Fiero. The Bonneville dash that was done in one was shortened to fit if i remember correctly.<P>The early 90's grand am, regal, olds, etc. dashes are just about the right size and shape to fit. (like Devotshka said) I keep eyeballing my sisters Grand Am dash||||reg||1
